{"about_the_game":"Inspired by classic RTS games, Flow of War offers a unique Real-Time Strategy (RTS) experience with  Auto-Micro mechanics for both Workers and Warriors. This allows you to concentrate on other aspects of a classic RTS without the need to micromanage individual units.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/6f8e3046d847df692db94dd7dbbb40b1.webp?t=1771441913\" width=389 height=42 /></span><br>Design a well-constructed base not only for good defense but also to allow workers to operate efficiently and perform their tasks in infinitely unique maps.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/f50301b3f70bb677deee4970656114d0.poster.avif?t=1771441913\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/f50301b3f70bb677deee4970656114d0.webm?t=1771441913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/f50301b3f70bb677deee4970656114d0.mp4?t=1771441913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/f1816d97e41fc36626a895bff11bee42.poster.avif?t=1771441913\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/f1816d97e41fc36626a895bff11bee42.webm?t=1771441913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/f1816d97e41fc36626a895bff11bee42.mp4?t=1771441913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/dd63d121835f8794ac9521008559af7e.avif?t=1771441913\" width=615 height=871 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/1ac558288d75f77c4a75adb831181fef.webp?t=1771441913\" width=389 height=42 /></span><br>Embrace the chaos and excitement of battles where multiple units are in action simultaneously.<br><br>Unlike other RTS while you have to micro every single unit, in Flow of War they will fight automatically and you can watch them like it\u2019s Esports!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/1c9c3f109ae122fd38d64cd5aca25d67.poster.avif?t=1771441913\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/1c9c3f109ae122fd38d64cd5aca25d67.webm?t=1771441913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/1c9c3f109ae122fd38d64cd5aca25d67.mp4?t=1771441913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/5ae7dda3cd5f5fffb97e7a530fa4bf60.poster.avif?t=1771441913\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/5ae7dda3cd5f5fffb97e7a530fa4bf60.webm?t=1771441913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/5ae7dda3cd5f5fffb97e7a530fa4bf60.mp4?t=1771441913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass